1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astorre_II_Manfredi it.wikipedia...] ; [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astorre_II_Manfredi en.wikipedia...] ; 
2 CONT
2 CONT December 8, 1412 – March 12, 1468) was lord of Imola from 1439 and of Faenza from 1443.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Faenza, the son of Gian Galeazzo I Manfredi. Apart Faenza and Imola, he was Papal vicar at Fusignano and other lands in Romagna together with his brother Gian Galeazzo II. He also fought as captain for several local
2 CONC  rulers.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1431 he married Giovanna da Barbiano, daughter of the famous condottiero Alberico da Barbiano. His sons Carlo and Galeotto were both lords of Faenza after Astorre's death.
