2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of condottiero Alfonso d'Avalos d´Aquino, (1502–1546). He constructed there a castle, in 1563, and created Terra Murata.
2 CONT
2 CONT His mother was Maria d´Aragona, from the family of the Dukes of Montalto
2 CONT
2 CONT After a period as lay administrator (he was for a while Chancellor of the Kingdom of Naples, he was made bishop of Mileto in 1566, bishop of Sabina in 1586, bishop of Frascati in 1589, bishop of Porto e Santa Rufina in 1591.
