2 CONT Profile photo: The Deposition, also known as the Pala Baglione, Borghese Deposition or The Entombment, is an oil painting by the Italian High Renaissance painter Raphael. Signed and dated "Raphael Urbinas MDVII (1507)", the painti
2 CONC ng is in the Galleria Borghese in Rome.It is the central panel of a larger altarpiece commissioned by Atalanta Baglioni of Perugia in honor of her of fallen son, Grifonetto Baglioni Like many works, it shares elements of the commo
2 CONC n subjects of the Deposition of Christ, the Lamentation of Christ, and the Entombment of Christ. 
