2 CONT * Eamon Duffy, Saints & Sinners: A History of the Popes (Yale Nota Bene, 2002)
2 CONT * Peter de Rossa, Vicars of Christ: The Dark Side of the Papacy (Corgi, 1989)
2 CONT * Encyclopædia Britannica, 11th edition.
2 CONT * Borja or Borgia (in Spanish)
2 CONT * DIARIO BORJA BORGIA (Spanish)
