2 CONT (a)       OTT [III] de Montcada .  Señor de Montcada e Aytona.  Zurita names “...don Ot de Moncada y don Guillen Ramon y don Pedro sus hijos...” among those accompanying Infante don Martín “el Duque de Monblanc” to the kingdom of 
2 CONC Sicily in 1392[2713].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ELSA de Luna, daughter of PEDRO Martínez de Luna & his wife Elsa de Ejérica [Aragón].  Otal y Valonga records her parentage and marriage without citing any sources which corroborate the information[2714].  The information 
2 CONC is confirmed by Zurita when recording that “don Antonio de Luna” died “en Mequinença, lugar de don Guillen Ramon de Moncada su sobrino”[2715].  A genealogical table of this family is shown in the online Gran enciclopedia catalana,
2 CONC  without citation of sources[2716].  -         COMTES de CAMMARATA. 
2 CONT
